{"id":70602,"date":"2026-10-23T20:18:22","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T19:18:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70602"},"modified":"2026-10-23T20:21:10","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T19:21:10","slug":"edicao-trail-running-carrossel-planalto-das-cesaredas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/edicao-trail-running-carrossel-planalto-das-cesaredas\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trail Running Carrossel Planalto das Cesaredas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trail Running Carrossel Planalto das Cesaredas 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>2\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trail Running Carrossel Planalto das Cesaredas 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no feriado de <strong>1 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (Ter\u00e7a-feira), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada na sede da <strong>A.C.D.R. Reguengo Grande<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Reguengo Grande<\/strong>, concelho da <strong>Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>). Integrado na organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Trof\u00e9u dos Dinossauros<\/strong>, o evento convida-te a correr no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da regi\u00e3o Oeste, com arranque matinal \u00e0s <strong>08:45<\/strong> para os escal\u00f5es jovens e partidas faseadas a partir das <strong>09:10<\/strong> para as provas principais.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Tra\u00e7ado sobre o maci\u00e7o calc\u00e1rio jur\u00e1ssico do <strong>Planalto das Cesaredas<\/strong> \u2014 paisagem natural e hist\u00f3rica marcada por campos de lapi\u00e1s, algares, vales agr\u00edcolas e trilhos panor\u00e2micos do Reguengo Grande \u2014, o evento apresenta quatro percursos adaptados a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: o <strong>Trail Sprint 26 km<\/strong> (1250m D+, tempo limite de 6 horas), o <strong>Trail Jovem \/ Mini Trail 13 km<\/strong> (450m D+, limite de 4 horas), a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (325m D+) e o <strong>Kids Trail<\/strong> gratuito para crian\u00e7as dos 4 aos 10 anos. Todos os percursos s\u00e3o balizados com fita rosa oficial e incluem kit com camisola t\u00e9cnica Neotech, meias t\u00e9cnicas Socksby e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A prova \u00e9 coorganizada pelo <strong>Trof\u00e9u dos Dinossauros<\/strong>, <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal da Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong>, <strong>Junta de Freguesia do Reguengo Grande<\/strong>, <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Toledo<\/strong> e <strong>A.C.D.R. Reguengo Grande<\/strong>, disponibilizando cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, postos de abastecimento l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, balne\u00e1rios para banhos, almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio opcional de feijoada e o espa\u00e7o infantil gratuito <strong>Cascata Fun Zone<\/strong> para os filhos dos atletas. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">