uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 1 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 325m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (Promocional):<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25\/10 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Trail (4 aos 10 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 1 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 2\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trail Running Carrossel Planalto das Cesaredas 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no feriado de 1 de Dezembro de 2026 (Ter\u00e7a-feira), com partida e chegada na sede da A.C.D.R. Reguengo Grande (coordenadas GPS: 39.286806, -9.216347), na freguesia de Reguengo Grande, concelho da Lourinh\u00e3, distrito de Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra quatro provas com partidas desdobradas: Kids Trail (4 aos 10 anos) \u00e0s 08:45; Trail Sprint 26 km (1250m D+) \u00e0s 09:10; Trail Jovem \/ Mini Trail 13 km (450m D+) \u00e0s 09:20; e Caminhada de 10 km (325m D+) \u00e0s 09:30. O aquecimento geral decorre \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 25 de Outubro a 15 de Novembro de 2026 (limite de 500 vagas no trail e 100 na caminhada). Na 1\u00aa Fase Promocional (25 a 31 de Outubro): Trail 26 km custa 18,00 \u20ac, Trail 13 km custa 15,00 \u20ac e Caminhada 10 km custa 12,00 \u20ac. Na 2\u00aa Fase (1 a 15 de Novembro): Trail 26 km passa a 20,00 \u20ac, Trail 13 km a 17,00 \u20ac e Caminhada 10 km a 13,00 \u20ac. O Kids Trail \u00e9 gratuito. O almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio opcional (feijoada) tem o custo de 10,00 \u20ac para atletas e 12,00 \u20ac para acompanhantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta e quando funciona o secretariado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail 26 km, Trail 13 km e Caminhada 10 km inclui Camisola T\u00e9cnica by Neotech, Meias T\u00e9cnicas Socksby, dorsal (com chip no trail), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos, medalha de finisher e acesso gratuito \u00e0 Cascata Fun Zone para os filhos dos atletas. O secretariado funciona na segunda-feira, 30 de Novembro (15:00 \u00e0s 19:30), e no dia da prova, 1 de Dezembro, das 07:15 \u00e0s 08:30 na A.C.D.R. Reguengo Grande.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite, abastecimentos e material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite \u00e9 de 6 horas para o Trail Sprint 26 km (com 3 abastecimentos aos ~6 km, ~12,5 km e ~20 km, mais meta) e de 4 horas para o Trail Jovem 13 km (abastecimento aos 6 km e na meta). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel com bateria, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua de pelo menos 0,5 L e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel, dado que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos nos abastecimentos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a 2\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Carrossel do Planalto das Cesaredas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 coorganizado pelo Trof\u00e9u dos Dinossauros, C\u00e2mara Municipal da Lourinh\u00e3, Junta de Freguesia do Reguengo Grande, Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Toledo e A.C.D.R. Reguengo Grande.<\/div>\n<\/details>